  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/Logos/logo-forge.png\" alt=\"标志\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n    |\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>\n    |\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a>\n    |\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge (Forge)</a>\n    |\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">发布版本 (Forge)</a>\n    |\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits-for-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge (Fabric)</a>\n    |\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits-for-fabric/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">发布版本 (Fabric)</a>\n    |\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n    |\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/ChiselsAndBits/Chisels-and-Bits/\" rel=\"nofollow\">代码</a> \n    |\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/ChiselsAndBits/Chisels-and-Bits/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题反馈</a>\n    |\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/ChiselsAndBits/Chisels-and-Bits/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">拉取请求</a> \n    |\n    <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/chisels_and_bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> \n    |\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.creeperhost.net%252fpartner%252fchisels-and-bits-glv\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreeperHost</a> \n    |\n</div>\n\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/chisels_and_bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/Patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n  </a>\n\n<div>\n  感谢您游玩我们的模组！如果您想支持我们继续开发《Chisels & Bits》的努力，请考虑在 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/chisels_and_bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 上支持我们。  \n</div>\n\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.creeperhost.net%252fpartner%252fchisels-and-bits-glv\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/CreeperHost.png\" alt=\"CreeperHost\">\n  </a>\n\n<div>\n  感谢 CreeperHost 慷慨的支持，现在购买服务器可享受 25% 的折扣。点击上方图片，或在结账时使用折扣码 'chisels-and-bits'！  \n</div>\n\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/ForForge.png\" alt=\"适用于 Forge\">\n\n\n  本模组专为 Minecraft Forge 开发。\n  因此，需要安装 Forge 才能正常运行。\n\n<div>\n  如果您想在 Fabric 上游玩《Chisels & Bits》，则需要使用另一个版本的模组。该版本专为与 Fabric、其加载器及其 API 配合使用而设计。\n  您可以在此处找到该特定版本的模组：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits-for-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>。\n</div>\n\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/Wiki.png\" alt=\"维基\">\n  </a>\n\n\n  我们尽力为模组编写尽可能详细的文档。\n  您可以在我们的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.chiselsandbits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a> 上找到相关文档。\n  如果您发现缺少某些内容，请告诉我们！\n\n<div>\n  我们所有的物品、方块和系统都在那里有详细记录。\n</div>\n\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/Discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\">\n  </a>\n\n\n  虽然我们设有专门的维基，可帮助您了解《Chisels & Bits》添加的所有物品、方块和系统，但我们也有一个专门的 Discord 服务器，您可以在上面提问、讨论想法并获得模组的帮助。   \n\n<div>\n  如果您想加入服务器，可以点击上方的图片，或点击 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a> 加入。   \n</div>\n\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/Contents.png\" alt=\"模组内容\">\n\n\n  《Chisels & Bits》是一款 Minecraft 模组，允许您将构成世界的巨大方块进行切割，并以任意方式将切下的微小碎片重新放置。\n  完全由您自由发挥。\n\n<div>\n  <div>想要更平滑的楼梯？没问题。</div>\n  <div>想要更美观的屋顶？或是圆柱？现在一切都成为可能。</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n  您可以通过混合搭配不同现有方块的碎片，创造出全新外观和手感的方块。\n</div>\n\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/CompatibilityVanilla.png\" alt=\"与原版兼容性\">\n\n\n  默认情况下，所有实心、简单的完整立方体方块（如原木、木板、矿石、存储块（钻石、绿宝石、铁等））均受支持。\n  此外，一些特定方块经过手动筛选，尤其是所有玻璃方块、树叶和草方块。  \n\n\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/CompatibilityMods.png\" alt=\"与模组兼容性\">\n\n\n    兼容方块扫描功能会自动检测所有已兼容的模组方块。\n    如果模组作者希望控制其方块的筛选流程，可以通过将它们添加到以下两个标签之一来实现：\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <code>chiselsandbits:chiselable/forced</code>\n    强制将该方块设为可雕刻状态（适用于类似玻璃的方块）\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <code> chiselsandbits:chiselable/blocked</code>\n    阻止原本可雕刻的方块被雕刻。\n  </li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
